{"2829500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Thorgard", "steam_appid": 2829500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/eafaa741a7b5b0f1370e84a76e843c5d.avif?t=1787832366\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras_big/eafaa741a7b5b0f1370e84a76e843c5d.webp?t=1787832366 width=1560 height=979 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/d09629ede636512e1de6d7c112bbe15b.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1059 height=117 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A legendary barrel of mead has attracted far more attention than anyone expected. Vikings, pirates, aliens... even ducks somehow got involved. Grab your axe, survive the chaos, and protect the last barrel before someone drinks it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/9ba7c02866f9a215922a9c20006f6b3d.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1059 height=117 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack your way through endless waves of enemies in this action roguelite. Your axe swings automatically, leaving you free to dodge, dash, and focus on staying alive while hundreds of enemies close in from every direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/35d695f76c057c21a2f93a6198c66e42.poster.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/35d695f76c057c21a2f93a6198c66e42.webm?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/35d695f76c057c21a2f93a6198c66e42.mp4?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/60b16838a0595d198b5776c9fca98b00.poster.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/60b16838a0595d198b5776c9fca98b00.webm?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/60b16838a0595d198b5776c9fca98b00.mp4?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/1b32a87a27f0e1dbffe80fe66463474e.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1059 height=117 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run earns you coins to unlock permanent upgrades, powerful abilities, and new ways to play. Experiment with different builds, become stronger between runs, and discover the perfect combination to survive even longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/edc7b00eb8d3341c6ee4528f8d31015f.poster.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/edc7b00eb8d3341c6ee4528f8d31015f.mp4?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/f79e8db9c50cc6ab3979102af27111c3.poster.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/f79e8db9c50cc6ab3979102af27111c3.webm?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/f79e8db9c50cc6ab3979102af27111c3.mp4?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/8b31f0d98d2c95d111e6b42d5b862f6a.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1059 height=117 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new Viking skins, customize your warrior, and spend your hard-earned coins in the shop. Feeling lucky? Try the slot machine for a chance to unlock even more cosmetics. Looking fabulous has never been this dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/4732fcc62673e0732f67fbd61a1d0cba.poster.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1058 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/4732fcc62673e0732f67fbd61a1d0cba.webm?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/4732fcc62673e0732f67fbd61a1d0cba.mp4?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/52325486a99143b17051b