s attracted far more attention than anyone expected. Vikings, pirates, aliens... even ducks somehow got involved. Grab your axe, survive the chaos, and protect the last barrel before someone drinks it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/9ba7c02866f9a215922a9c20006f6b3d.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1059 height=117 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack your way through endless waves of enemies in this action roguelite. Your axe swings automatically, leaving you free to dodge, dash, and focus on staying alive while hundreds of enemies close in from every direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/35d695f76c057c21a2f93a6198c66e42.poster.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/35d695f76c057c21a2f93a6198c66e42.webm?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/35d695f76c057c21a2f93a6198c66e42.mp4?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/60b16838a0595d198b5776c9fca98b00.poster.avif?t=1787832366\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/60b16838a0595d198b5776c9fca98b00.webm?t=1787832366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829500/extras/60b16838a0595d198